---json
{
  "layout": "layouts/sales.njk",
  "title": "Welcome to Practical Stock Planner",
  "description": "Your 14-day free trial has started. You won't be charged until it ends. Your Practical Stock Planner licence key is on its way by email from support@practicalsupplychainplanning.com.",
  "canonical": "https://practicalsupplychainplanning.com/welcome/",
  "robots": "noindex",
  "stripQuery": true,
  "eleventyExcludeFromCollections": true,
  "permalink": "/welcome/"
}
---
<h1 class="page-title">Thanks, you&rsquo;re in!</h1>
<p class="sales-lead">
  You&rsquo;re in. Your 14-day free trial has started. You won&rsquo;t be charged until it ends. Welcome to Practical Stock Planner.
</p>

<section class="sales-panel" aria-labelledby="licence-heading">
  <h2 id="licence-heading">Check your email for your licence key</h2>
  <p>
    Within a few minutes you&rsquo;ll get an email from
    <strong>
      <a class="support-email" href="mailto:support@practicalsupplychainplanning.com">support@practicalsupplychainplanning.com</a>
    </strong>
    with the subject <em>&ldquo;Your Practical Stock Planner licence key&rdquo;</em>.
    It contains your licence key and download link.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Can&rsquo;t see it?</strong>
    Check your <strong>spam, junk or promotions</strong> folder and search for
    <em class="support-email">support@practicalsupplychainplanning.com</em>.
    Still nothing after 15 minutes? Email us with the address you used at checkout
    and your Paddle order number, and we&rsquo;ll resend your key.
  </p>
  <p>
    You&rsquo;ll also get a receipt from <strong>Paddle</strong>. Keep it: it has
    the links to manage or cancel your subscription.
  </p>
  <div class="sales-download">
    <button type="button" class="sales-button" disabled>
      Download Practical Stock Planner for Windows
    </button>
    <p class="sales-note">
      <strong>Coming soon.</strong>
      The download will be available here shortly; we&rsquo;ll also email you the link.
    </p>
    <p class="sales-note">
      Windows SmartScreen may show &ldquo;Windows protected your PC&rdquo; and &ldquo;Unknown publisher&rdquo;, because Practical Stock Planner isn&rsquo;t code-signed yet. To continue, click &ldquo;More info&rdquo;, then &ldquo;Run anyway&rdquo;. The download comes only from practicalsupplychainplanning.com. Code signing is planned.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sales-panel" aria-labelledby="steps-heading">
  <h2 id="steps-heading">Get started in 3 steps</h2>
  <ol class="sales-steps">
    <li>
      <strong>Install and activate.</strong>
      Run the installer, open Practical Stock Planner and enter your licence key.
      You&rsquo;ll need an internet connection for this step.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Fill in the templates.</strong>
      Download the Excel templates from the app, then export your products, stock,
      orders and purchase orders from Shopify or Xero and paste them in.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Run your plan.</strong>
      Load the files, check your default lead time and safety stock settings, and
      see period by period what to order and when.
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>

{%- set publishedGuides = exportGuides | withHref %}
{%- if publishedGuides.length %}
<section class="sales-panel" aria-labelledby="data-heading">
  <h2 id="data-heading">Getting your data ready</h2>
  <ul class="sales-guides">
    {%- for guide in publishedGuides %}
    <li>
      <a href="{{ guide.href | trim }}">{{ guide.label }}</a>
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
{%- endif %}

<section class="sales-panel" aria-labelledby="help-heading">
  <h2 id="help-heading">Need a hand?</h2>
  <p>
    Email
    <a class="support-email" href="mailto:support@practicalsupplychainplanning.com">support@practicalsupplychainplanning.com</a>
    and Daniel will help you get set up.
  </p>
  <p>
    Refund details are on our <a href="/refunds/">refunds page</a>.
  </p>
</section>
